# Life OS — environment
#
# Life OS has NO backend and NO server-side secrets. There is nothing to put here
# for the app to run: `npm run dev` works with this file absent.
#
# The only secret in the product is the Groq API key, and it is deliberately NOT
# an env var. Per Development Master section 9 it is entered once by the user in
# Settings > AI and stored in browser local storage on their own device — never
# committed, never baked into the bundle, never logged.
#
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the client bundle at build time and is
# therefore PUBLIC. Never put a credential behind a VITE_ prefix.

# Optional. Overrides the Groq endpoint (e.g. to point at a local mock in dev).
# VITE_GROQ_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
